  annotation(Documentation(info="<html><h2>热控控制器组件</h2><p><b>类路径：</b><code>OneSatSim.Components.ThermalControllerUnit</code>　<b>类型：</b>model</p><h3>用途与定位</h3><p>热控控制器组件</p><h3>在工程中使用</h3><p>当前直接使用位置：<a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Systems.N_systems.ThermalControlSystem\">OneSatSim.Systems.N_systems.ThermalControlSystem</a> 的 <code>controller</code>。</p><h3>接口、输入与输出</h3><table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"5\"><tr><th>名称/维数</th><th>类型</th><th>声明角色</th><th>单位</th><th>含义</th></tr><tr><td><code>power</code></td><td>Foundation.Interfaces.PowerPort</td><td>public</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>功率</td></tr><tr><td><code>thermal</code></td><td>Foundation.Interfaces.ThermalPort</td><td>public</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>热学</td></tr><tr><td><code>mechanical</code></td><td>Foundation.Interfaces.MechanicalPort</td><td>public</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>机械</td></tr><tr><td><code>information</code></td><td>Foundation.Interfaces.InformationPort</td><td>public</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>计算/接口量 information</td></tr><tr><td><code>measuredTemperature[14]</code></td><td>Foundation.Interfaces.RealSignalReader</td><td>public</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>可扩展总线实数信号到因果计算端口的无状态恒等读取器实例；Unique controlled sources: wing 3, eleven camera nodes and two battery nodes</td></tr><tr><td><code>informationRealBridge[46]</code></td><td>Foundation.Interfaces.RealSignalBridge</td><td>public</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>实数因果输出到可扩展信息总线的无状态恒等桥实例</td></tr><tr><td><code>informationIntegerBridge[24]</code></td><td>Foundation.Interfaces.IntegerSignalBridge</td><td>public</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>整数因果输出到可扩展信息总线的无状态恒等桥实例</td></tr><tr><td><code>informationBooleanBridge[32]</code></td><td>Foundation.Interfaces.BooleanSignalBridge</td><td>public</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>布尔因果输出到可扩展信息总线的无状态恒等桥实例</td></tr></table><h3>配置与参数</h3><p>下面列出当前源码表达式，仅用于阅读；当前参数对话框、生效配置记录与原有配置工具仍是使用依据。本页不新增默认值或换算。</p><table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"5\"><tr><th>参数</th><th>类型</th><th>用途</th><th>源码表达式</th></tr><tr><td><code>config</code></td><td>OneSatSim.Scenarios.DesignConfigRecords.ControllerComponentConfig</td><td>由所属N-System传入的硬件设计配置</td><td><code>由调用方、继承或默认声明提供</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>boardLoadResistance</code></td><td>Modelica.Units.SI.Resistance</td><td>热控控制器板负载电阻；Excel单位Ω，当前设计基线</td><td><code>=config.BoardLoadResistance</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>boardHeatCapacity</code></td><td>Modelica.Units.SI.HeatCapacity</td><td>热控控制器板热容；Excel单位J/K，当前设计基线</td><td><code>=config.BoardHeatCapacity</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>mountConductance</code></td><td>Modelica.Units.SI.ThermalConductance</td><td>热控控制器安装导热；Excel单位W/K，当前设计基线</td><td><code>=config.MountConductance</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>mass</code></td><td>Modelica.Units.SI.Mass</td><td>质量；Excel单位kg，当前设计基线</td><td><code>=config.Mass</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>rcm_X</code></td><td>Modelica.Units.SI.Length</td><td>质心偏置X；Excel单位m，当前设计基线</td><td><code>=config.RCM_X</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>rcm_Y</code></td><td>Modelica.Units.SI.Length</td><td>质心偏置Y；Excel单位m，当前设计基线</td><td><code>=config.RCM_Y</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>rcm_Z</code></td><td>Modelica.Units.SI.Length</td><td>质心偏置Z；Excel单位m，当前设计基线</td><td><code>=config.RCM_Z</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>inertia_XX</code></td><td>Modelica.Units.SI.Inertia</td><td>局部惯量 Ixx；Excel单位kg·m²，当前设计基线</td><td><code>=config.Inertia_XX</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>inertia_YY</code></td><td>Modelica.Units.SI.Inertia</td><td>局部惯量 Iyy；Excel单位kg·m²，当前设计基线</td><td><code>=config.Inertia_YY</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>inertia_ZZ</code></td><td>Modelica.Units.SI.Inertia</td><td>局部惯量 Izz；Excel单位kg·m²，当前设计基线</td><td><code>=config.Inertia_ZZ</code></td></tr></table><h3>内部组成</h3><p>以下为本类直接声明的组成单元，继承类的内部结构另按其文档查看。</p><table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"5\"><tr><th>实例</th><th>类</th><th>作用</th></tr><tr><td><code>unused12Rail</code></td><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Basic.Conductor\">Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Basic.Conductor</a></td><td>计算/接口量 unused12Rail</td></tr><tr><td><code>unused33Rail</code></td><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Basic.Conductor\">Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Basic.Conductor</a></td><td>计算/接口量 unused33Rail</td></tr><tr><td><code>heaterLogic[14]</code></td><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Hysteresis\">Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Hysteresis</a></td><td>计算/接口量 heaterLogic；Survival heat for wing/camera; tighter operating band for battery</td></tr><tr><td><code>heaterDemand[14]</code></td><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Not\">Modelica.Blocks.Logical.Not</a></td><td>heater需求</td></tr><tr><td><code>heaterState[14]</code></td><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Math.BooleanToInteger\">Modelica.Blocks.Math.BooleanToInteger</a></td><td>heater状态</td></tr><tr><td><code>upper[14]</code></td><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Sources.Constant\">Modelica.Blocks.Sources.Constant</a></td><td>上界</td></tr><tr><td><code>lower[14]</code></td><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Sources.Constant\">Modelica.Blocks.Sources.Constant</a></td><td>下界</td></tr><tr><td><code>enabledDevice[9]</code></td><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Sources.IntegerConstant\">Modelica.Blocks.Sources.IntegerConstant</a></td><td>启用Device</td></tr><tr><td><code>backupStandby</code></td><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Sources.IntegerConstant\">Modelica.Blocks.Sources.IntegerConstant</a></td><td>计算/接口量 backupStandby</td></tr><tr><td><code>inactiveCurrent[5]</code></td><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Sources.Constant\">Modelica.Blocks.Sources.Constant</a></td><td>未激活电流</td></tr><tr><td><code>unmodeledThermistorPlaceholder[12]</code></td><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Sources.Constant\">Modelica.Blocks.Sources.Constant</a></td><td>计算/接口量 unmodeledThermistorPlaceholder；UNMODELED placeholders only; see THERMISTOR_MODELING_AUDIT.md</td></tr><tr><td><code>thermistorValidity[32]</code></td><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Blocks.Sources.BooleanConstant\">Modelica.Blocks.Sources.BooleanConstant</a></td><td>计算/接口量 thermistorValidity；CALCULATED validity mask; false channels are 293.15 K interface placeholders</td></tr><tr><td><code>boardLoad</code></td><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Basic.Resistor\">Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Basic.Resistor</a></td><td>board负载</td></tr><tr><td><code>boardNode</code></td><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Components.HeatCapacitor\">Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Components.HeatCapacitor</a></td><td>计算/接口量 boardNode</td></tr><tr><td><code>baseplate</code></td><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Components.ThermalConductor\">Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Components.ThermalConductor</a></td><td>计算/接口量 baseplate</td></tr><tr><td><code>thermistor1</code></td><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sensors.TemperatureSensor\">Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sensors.TemperatureSensor</a></td><td>计算/接口量 thermistor1</td></tr><tr><td><code>tcbBody</code></td><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts.Body\">Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts.Body</a></td><td>tcb本体</td></tr></table></html>"
